        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2006] After receiving the DC_PreChargeReq with EVProcessing set to \"Finished\", the SECC shall respond with a DC_PreChargeRes within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 217. The next allowed request shall be PowerDeliveryReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                167,
                1122,
                273
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    273.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    273.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2010] If the PowerDeliveryReq received has ChargeProgress = \"Start\" and ServiceName = DC or DC_BPT in Table 204 was selected, the next allowed request shall be DC_ChargeLoopReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 217.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                294,
                1122,
                399
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    294.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    294.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    399.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    399.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2013] After receiving the DC_ChargeLoopReq, the SECC shall respond with a DC_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\" within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 217. The next allowed request shall be DC_ChargeLoopReq or PowerDeliveryReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 217.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                421,
                1122,
                553
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    421.0
                ],
