        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1631] After receiving the DC_WeldingDetectionReq with EVProcessing set to \"Finished\", the SECC shall respond with a DC_WeldingDetectionRes within V2G_SECC_Msg_Performance_Time according to Table 217. The next allowed request shall be SessionStopReq and the V2G_SECC_Sequence_Timeout is set according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
